WEBVTT

NOTE
Canonical written narration timed from the exact local narration render receipt.
Pronunciation-only substitutions are intentionally absent from caption text.

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.943
This chapter asks a specific question: The architecture needs a way

2
00:00:04.943 --> 00:00:09.825
to move capability claims through evidence without overfitting to fixed benchmarks.

3
00:00:09.825 --> 00:00:14.264
The tempting shortcut is insufficient: Benchmarks can saturate, be gamed,

4
00:00:14.264 --> 00:00:17.815
erase regressions, or fail to represent real requirements.

5
00:00:18.415 --> 00:00:24.321
The chapter's core claim is this: Benchmark Ratchets and Anti-Goodhart Evidence

6
00:00:24.321 --> 00:00:30.226
owns a construct-, task-, dataset-, metric-, harness-, model-, checkpoint-, output-, evaluator-,

7
00:00:30.226 --> 00:00:35.595
baseline-, retry-lineage-, budget-, environment-, claim-axis-, and time-specific Benchmark Instrument Lease:

8
00:00:35.935 --> 00:00:41.379
a score or evaluation event may update only the exact claim

9
00:00:41.379 --> 00:00:46.822
whose construct validity, target capacity, data and metric provenance, output binding,

10
00:00:46.822 --> 00:00:51.276
contamination and public-calibration boundary, strong baselines and negative controls,

11
00:00:51.276 --> 00:00:54.740
complete selection and failure lineage, regression floors,

12
00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:59.176
frontier state, uncertainty, costs, causal checks, transfer, residuals,

13
00:00:59.176 --> 00:01:04.295
and decision authority survive review; a green fixture, synthetic probe,

14
00:01:04.295 --> 00:01:08.391
source-reported result, leaderboard gain, held-out score, saturation label,

15
00:01:08.391 --> 00:01:13.510
or archived winner alone confers no capability, safety, readiness, deployment,

16
00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:16.030
unlearning, support, transfer.

17
00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:20.660
A concrete implementation trace makes the proposal testable.

18
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:26.472
The exact current minimum is one benchmark-ratchet schema and valid record

19
00:01:26.472 --> 00:01:31.944
fixture; one metric-provenance schema with one valid blocked six-project-lineage record and

20
00:01:31.944 --> 00:01:37.415
ten rejecting mutations; one synthetic anti-Goodhart harness with two valid records

21
00:01:37.415 --> 00:01:39.405
and five expected-invalid controls;

22
00:01:39.745 --> 00:01:45.702
one persisted executable fixture result aligned to the same two-valid/five-invalid set;

23
00:01:45.702 --> 00:01:51.659
three proof targets; and three local BenchmarkRatchets declarations proving input-general finite

24
00:01:51.659 --> 00:01:57.075
decision consequences. Executable fixture totals are not copied into Lean.

25
00:01:57.675 --> 00:02:02.450
The design can still fail. A benchmark score substitutes for a

26
00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:05.922
defined construct, natural workload, or real consumer need.

27
00:02:05.922 --> 00:02:10.696
The target behavior is not expressible by the architecture, prompt, tools,

28
00:02:10.696 --> 00:02:15.471
context, action space, or observation channel, but failure is attributed to

29
00:02:15.471 --> 00:02:15.905
capability.

30
00:02:16.245 --> 00:02:20.665
A build check, schema, fixture, synthetic probe, source-reported number,

31
00:02:20.665 --> 00:02:25.085
or replayed headline is presented as empirical capability evidence.

32
00:02:25.085 --> 00:02:30.487
Metric origin or transformations are obscured, or a proxy, constant, vacuous,

33
00:02:30.487 --> 00:02:33.925
modeled, or source-reported value is labeled measured.

34
00:02:34.265 --> 00:02:38.234
The correct response is to stop, narrow, quarantine, compensate,

35
00:02:38.234 --> 00:02:42.645
or retain an owned residual rather than narrate uncertainty away.

36
00:02:43.245 --> 00:02:48.291
This chapter remains Design rationale at argument support. Its contracts, examples,

37
00:02:48.291 --> 00:02:52.420
tests, or local artifacts establish only their encoded scope.

38
00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:57.466
The chapter names proof targets rather than pretending they are already

39
00:02:57.466 --> 00:02:57.925
closed.

40
00:02:58.265 --> 00:03:03.842
An accepted readiness-promotion decision in the finite ratchet model requires transfer-or-mutation

41
00:03:03.842 --> 00:03:07.897
checks, preserved negative evidence, and preserved regression records.

42
00:03:07.897 --> 00:03:13.474
An accepted contaminated benchmark review cannot select readiness promotion in the

43
00:03:13.474 --> 00:03:14.995
finite ratchet model.

44
00:03:15.335 --> 00:03:21.875
An independent benchmark anti-Goodhart consumer computes two valid fixtures and five

45
00:03:21.875 --> 00:03:28.414
rejected controls; separately, retained quantified ratchet theorems require clean transfer-or-mutation checks,

46
00:03:28.414 --> 00:03:33.765
negative-evidence preservation, and regression records and reject contaminated promotion.

47
00:03:34.365 --> 00:03:39.329
No chapter claim or evidence state is promoted by this visual.

48
00:03:39.329 --> 00:03:44.293
A named mechanism is not proof of correct implementation or useful

49
00:03:44.293 --> 00:03:49.257
deployment. A local check or formal model does not establish real-world

50
00:03:49.257 --> 00:03:53.770
enforcement. No safety, transfer, state-of-the-art, AGI, or ASI conclusion follows.

51
00:03:54.110 --> 00:03:58.585
These boundaries matter because an explanatory derivative is useful only if

52
00:03:58.585 --> 00:04:01.840
it preserves the evidence ceiling of its source.

53
00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:07.925
At most, this visual explains the chapter's design rationale at argument

54
00:04:07.925 --> 00:04:12.912
support; it adds no empirical, deployment, safety, transfer, state-of-the-art, AGI,

55
00:04:12.912 --> 00:04:17.899
or ASI result. The next chapter is White-Box Evidence, Interpretability,

56
00:04:17.899 --> 00:04:19.395
and Activation Governance.

57
00:04:19.735 --> 00:04:24.775
It takes responsibility for Behavioral tests can reveal what a model

58
00:04:24.775 --> 00:04:28.441
did without identifying the internal features, circuits, representations,

59
00:04:28.441 --> 00:04:31.190
or causal pathways that produced it.
